              game development, hardware, software architecture,
              documentation, and project management.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="community-environment">
            <span>ENGINEERING LAB</span>
            <span>MAKER SPACE</span>
            <span>AI LAB</span>
            <span>CREATOR STUDIO</span>
            <span>COLLABORATION SPACE</span>
            <span>COMMUNITY SPACE</span>
            <span>RECOVERY / QUIET SPACE</span>
